	"Description": "[b][size=5]简介[/size][/b]\n<br />星露谷物语 NPC 婚后事件扩展\n<br />目前仅包含海莉 / 艾米丽的扩展内容——在完成原版海莉 / 艾米丽的14心事件后，你可以在镇上为她开一家烘焙店 / 服装店。\n<br />潘妮和亚历克斯的模组正在开发与测试中，今后会考虑与多婚模组（Polyamory Sweet）的兼容性。\n<br />如果你有任何建议或者在游玩过程中发现任何Bug，欢迎在评论区向作者反馈。\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Description[/size][/b]\n<br />Stardew Valley NPCs post-Marriage Event Expanded.\n<br />For now, only Haley / Emily's expansion is included — after completing her original 14-heart event, you can open a bakery / clothing shop for her in town. Mods for Penny and Alex are currently in development and testing, and we will consider compatibility with Polyamory Sweet in the future.\n<br />If you have any suggestions or find any bugs during gameplay, feel free to provide feedback to the author in the comments section.",
